/T (Risks are inherent in procurement and supply chains. There is no decision without uncertainty. The purpose of 15M Risk Management is to ensure that risk considerations are systematically embedded in all procurement decisions. The objective is not to eliminate risk; on the contrary, risks must therefore be managed consciously, balancing whether they should be avoided, mitigated, or deliberately accepted.)
/E (Risks are inherent in procurement and supply chains. There is no decision without uncertainty. The purpose of 15M Risk Management is to ensure that risk considerations are systematically embedded in all procurement decisions. The objective is not to eliminate risk; on the contrary, risks must therefore be managed consciously, balancing whether they should be avoided, mitigated, or deliberately accepted.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
