/Title (The implementation of 15M Risk Management is embedded within the broader strategic transformation of procurement using the 15M Architecture. This approach starts with a risk-oriented maturity assessment within the Procurement Framework Strategy. The assessment can be conducted at varying levels of depth, from a basic inventory based on the 15 modules to a more advanced evaluation with a maturity score. In both cases, the objective is to identify and prioritize improvement opportunities. Based on these insights, the Framework Strategy defines strategic directions to establish or further develop key elements of the Procurement Management System.)
